note.p:
The final total vote count was: Pak Chung-hui, 4,702,640; Yun Po-sun, 4,546,614;
                    three other minor candidates, a total of 1,031,944. There were 954,977 invalid
                    ballots and 1,948,840 abstentions. (Telegram 525 from Seoul, October 18;
                    ibid.)
